OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ANew EU industry rules would damage UK,
OL,4,Awarns Burnham
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister said he was
OL,7,Fconcerned about how British industry
OL,8,Fand supply chains could be affected,
OL,9,Fand would raise the subject with von
OL,10,Fder Leyen when he meets her during a UN
OL,11,Fsummit in New York.
OL,13,FSpeaking on the flight to the US,
OL,14,FBurnham also declined to rule out
OL,15,Fcommitting to rejoining the EU in
OL,16,FLabour's next manifesto, saying it was
OL,17,Fan issue "for another day".
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
