OL,3,ALithuania ready to 'fight back' but has
OL,4,Aevacuation plans in face of Russia
OL,5,Athreats, PM tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe told Newsnight if his country was
OL,8,Fattacked, "we will fight back... we
OL,9,Fwill engage". But he said there were
OL,10,Fplans for a "variety of scenarios" and
OL,11,Fused an example of getting elderly
OL,12,Fcitizens out of cities "smoothly" and
OL,13,Favoiding traffic jams.
OL,15,FLithuania, a Nato member, shares a land
OL,16,Fborder with the Russian exclave of
OL,17,FKaliningrad.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
